Kingdom Come: Deliver Us -- authors and lineage
=============================================

This is a modified version of Kingdom Come: Together, ported to the first game. The official
repository of that project is https://github.com/DeepFriedDepp/KingdomCome-Together .
This port is not part of it and is not one of its releases.


In order of lineage
-------------------

1. The original project: marczukmichal/kcd2-multiplayer
   https://github.com/marczukmichal/kcd2-multiplayer

   Written by marczukmichal, with the contributions made to that project.
   This project continues it with the original developer's permission. The
   original author, and that project's contributors, keep the copyright on
   their code that remains here. The original repository carries no license
   of its own; nothing here claims that it did.

2. This project: DeepFriedDepp/KingdomCome-Together
   https://github.com/DeepFriedDepp/KingdomCome-Together

   Maintained by DeepFriedDepp. Its own code, from the point of forking on, is
   Copyright (C) 2026 the Kingdom Come: Together contributors, and is licensed
   under the GNU General Public License version 3 (LICENSE) with the additional
   terms of its section 7 in NOTICE. Every contributor is recorded in the git
   history of the official repository.


Whose game it is
----------------

This project's copyright covers only its own code. Kingdom Come: Deliverance
(and Kingdom Come: Deliverance II), its assets and its content belong to Warhorse Studios and PLAION.
Kingdom Come: Deliver Us is unofficial and free, and is not affiliated with or
endorsed by Warhorse Studios, Deep Silver or PLAION. The mod ships none of the
game's files.


3. This port: Kingdom Come: Deliver Us
   Its own code, from the point of the port on, is Copyright (C) 2026 the Kingdom Come: Deliver Us
   contributors, and is licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3 (LICENSE)
   with the additional terms of NOTICE.
